1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,760
Hello. Um my family and I are staying here in Trebirch for a week or two

2
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:08,940
and we wanted to know about the train services

3
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:11,880
We're hoping to do a few local trips.

4
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:18,140
OK. Well, I can give you lots of details about all the trains going from Trebirch in the South West.

5
00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:23,690
This leaflet will be very helpful but I can tell you some of the main things.

6
00:00:23,690 --> 00:00:26,970
We've got two main train stations in the town.

7
00:00:26,970 --> 00:00:31,600
King Street is for local commuter lines and regional services.

8
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:36,600
What about trains to London? I'll need to go there on business for one day.

9
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:41,880
Then you need to go to Central Station. That's for all the national services.

10
00:00:41,880 --> 00:00:43,940
There are regular trains to London.

11
00:00:43,940 --> 00:00:49,460
They leave Trebirch every half hour on weekdays and every hour at weekends.

12
00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:53,300
It takes about two hours, a bit longer on Sundays.

13
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:58,044
You've got a choice of first and second class and there's a buffet car -

14
00:00:58,044 --> 00:01:02,110
though refreshments are included in the cost of a first class ticket.

15
00:01:02,110 --> 00:01:07,840
Ah right. Urn, and have you got any information on different ticket types?

16
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:11,940
Yes. There's a range of ticket prices depending on

17
00:01:11,940 --> 00:01:14,690
when you travel and when you buy your ticket.

18
00:01:14,690 --> 00:01:20,500
There's a standard open ticket which doesn't have any restrictions.

19
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:23,650
This can be bought in advance or on the day.

20
00:01:23,650 --> 00:01:27,440
You can also get various discounted tickets.

21
00:01:27,440 --> 00:01:34,710
A popular one is called the Supersave and, er, this is OK for travel after 8.45.

22
00:01:34,710 --> 00:01:41,130
Then there is the Special ticket, which is valid for travel after 10.15.

23
00:01:41,130 --> 00:01:45,800
The Special tickets are also valid for travel at weekends.

24
00:01:45,800 --> 00:01:49,000
The cheapest tickets are called Advance

25
00:01:49,020 --> 00:01:52,800
and you have to buy them at least six days ahead.

26
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:55,740
Only a certain number are available

27
00:01:55,880 --> 00:01:58,640
and you have to make seat reservations for these.

28
00:01:58,640 --> 00:02:03,800
Thanks. And are there lots of places to go to around here?

29
00:02:03,800 --> 00:02:07,800
Oh yes. You can enjoy many days out.

30
00:02:07,800 --> 00:02:11,400
Um there's the Merthyr Mining Museum

31
00:02:11,740 --> 00:02:14,950
which is only half an hour from Trebirch by train.

32
00:02:14,950 --> 00:02:19,312
Your children will find it just as fascinating as any theme park

33
00:02:19,312 --> 00:02:24,400
and they can ride in the original miners' lifts and on the coal trains.

34
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:29,090
There are special excursion tickets which include entrance fees.

35
00:02:29,090 --> 00:02:33,280
Mainline trains also offer direct services to Bristol

36
00:02:33,300 --> 00:02:35,993
where you can visit the docks or spend a great day out

37
00:02:35,993 --> 00:02:38,500
with the children in the zoo

38
00:02:38,700 --> 00:02:42,550
which is set in the parkland that used to surround the old castle.

39
00:02:42,550 --> 00:02:48,250
Er, special family awayday fares are available for this service now during the school holidays.

40
00:02:48,250 --> 00:02:54,200
Er, alternatively, you can be in Birmingham in only an hour and a half

41
00:02:54,440 --> 00:02:56,003
where there's lots to see

42
00:02:56,003 --> 00:02:56,820
and do including the new

43
00:02:56,820 --> 00:03:02,940
and internationally-acclaimed climbing wall built on the site of the old aquarium.

44
00:03:02,940 --> 00:03:05,800
We will also be running a special service to Newport

45
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:09,488
when the new science museum opens next year,

46
00:03:09,488 --> 00:03:13,490
as we anticipate a lot of visitors in the opening weeks.

47
00:03:13,490 --> 00:03:17,920
I'd advise you to call early to book your tickets. Is that OK?

48
00:03:17,920 --> 00:03:18,310
Yes, thanks.
